  <h1>Understanding the Neural Tangent Kernel</h1>

  <div class=3D"entry">
   =20

<figure style=3D"margin: auto auto; text-align: center; width:100%" vertica=
l-align=3D"middle">
    <img src=3D"https://rajatvd.github.io/images/ntk/ellipses107.gif" alt=
